  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:50.960" end="00:55.710" ttm:agent="v1">Trying hard now</p>
      <p begin="00:55.710" end="01:01.030" ttm:agent="v1">It's so hard now</p>
      <p begin="01:01.030" end="01:06.230" ttm:agent="v1">Trying hard now</p>
      <p begin="01:06.230" end="01:07.730" ttm:agent="v1">Oh, he's ready</p>
      <p begin="01:07.450" end="01:08.950" ttm:agent="v1">Gonna make a move, yeah</p>
      <p begin="01:08.330" end="01:09.830" ttm:agent="v1">Oh, he's ready</p>
      <p begin="01:09.460" end="01:11.100" ttm:agent="v1">And makin' moves, yeah</p>
      <p begin="01:11.100" end="01:19.100" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, yeah</p>
      <p begin="01:46.200" end="01:51.160" ttm:agent="v1">Getting strong now</p>
      <p begin="01:51.160" end="01:55.980" ttm:agent="v1">Won't be long now</p>
      <p begin="01:55.980" end="02:03.980" ttm:agent="v1">Getting strong now</p>
      <p begin="02:20.600" end="02:25.050" ttm:agent="v1">Gonna fly now</p>
      <p begin="02:25.050" end="02:30.250" ttm:agent="v1">Flying high now</p>
      <p begin="02:30.250" end="02:38.250" ttm:agent="v1">Gonna fly, fly</p>
